OL,3,GNEWSAMinisters have role to play in WRU
OL,4,Aregions shake-up, Reform MS says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government has a role to play
OL,7,Fin holding Welsh Rugby Union (WRU) to
OL,8,Faccount over its planned changes to the
OL,9,Fgame, a Reform UK politician has said.
OL,11,FLlyr Powell made the comments after his
OL,12,Fparty was narrowly defeated in a Senedd
OL,13,Fdebate after calling for ministers to
OL,14,Fsupport four professional regions.
OL,16,FHe said in the same way the Senedd
OL,17,Fchamber sent a signal to Tata about the
OL,18,Fimportance of steel jobs in Wales, it
OL,19,Fshould do the same to the WRU about
OL,20,Ffour rugby sides.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
